WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:27.170
Are you okay, Gai?

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:29.960
What are you doing?

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:32.630
Go home, miss.

00:01:33.050 --> 00:01:36.380
If you get involved with that guy,
it'll ruin your future.

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:41.560
Regression to childhood, eh?

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:44.350
But you can't run from who you are.

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:48.480
Show me what you really are!

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:49.900
Enough!

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:53.190
Just kidding.

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:54.940
Mr. Kigetsu!

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:56.400
Who are you, old man?

00:01:56.860 --> 00:01:58.910
You're with the Shoshidai, right?

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:12.040
So, Shoshidai boy,
what do you intend to do with the kid?

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:14.170
That depends on him.

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:17.760
If he can control himself,
I take him to the Shoshidai.

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:19.550
But if he becomes a Busoma...

00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:21.550
I kill him.

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:23.470
Don't kill him!

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:27.560
So, old man, how do you know
about the Shoshidai?

00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:31.270
As you get old,
you form all sorts of relationships.

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:32.900
Not just the Shoshidai.

00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:37.070
Like, for example, with the Gabi.

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:38.820
The Gabi?

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:45.740
They're not even worth mentioning.
They're just playing a child's game.

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:49.330
The most they could do is get in our way.

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:51.880
That is unforgivable.

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:54.840
We're just playing a child's game?

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.880
It is heresy to use evil to defeat evil.

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:03.640
Indeed, the righteous path
is for human hands to defeat Busoma.

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:06.260
This is Soin of the Gabi.

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:09.770
He's been residing here
as he tracks down a Busoma.

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:16.020
I hate watching the Gabi play soldier.
You're merely human, after all.

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:19.400
Fighting Busoma is too difficult
a task for you.

00:03:19.610 --> 00:03:25.160
The wicked Shoshidai should back off.
Alas, you too will become Busoma.

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:28.660
Perhaps I should kill you here.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:31.420
Oh, you want to fight?

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.420
Mr. Kigetsu!

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.760
Looks like they won't be satisfied
unless they fight.

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:44.760
You don't often get to see a fight
between the Gabi and the Shoshidai.

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:53.940
The Gabi wield the techniques
of the Hollow Kenpo school.

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:58.530
We empty our minds and gather
our divine energy into a single punch,

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:01.900
and here, is the fist of justice!

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:07.870
Look at that powerful aura!

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:09.750
Mr. Kigetsu, please stop them!

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:14.250
No way! I want to see the fight!

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:24.010
I see.

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:26.890
I take back what I said.

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:30.020
I didn't think you could make me
use my Chakram.

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:37.690
Now it's my turn!

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:41.320
Maybe one of them will die here.

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:48.990
You...

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:52.580
Hey, what about your fight with me?

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:55.870
I'm sorry! Gai is a child right now!

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:56.790
Move!

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:01.050
A child? Nonsense!
His aura is filled with evil!

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:15.440
A Busoma?
It was hidden within his shadow?

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:20.150
The Busoma he was chasing waited
in his shadow for a chance to strike?

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:49.390
So, he's finally awakened?

00:06:06.990 --> 00:06:10.490
That's not Gai. That's not the Gai I know!

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:13.030
His aura is overwhelming.

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:17.120
Good. Show me what you really are.

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:21.750
Gai!

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:27.760
Is it over?

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:31.390
Not yet.
His murderous aura is still strong.

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:40.810
It ran away?

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:49.820
Looks like I have to find out for myself
whether you'll become a Busoma!

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:55.080
The Shoshidai
and the child with the Shiryu.

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:58.330
Looks like the child is at a disadvantage.

00:06:58.410 --> 00:06:59.250
Stop it!

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:00.620
Here we go!

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:11.130
Gai!

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:14.100
Gai! Hang in there! Gai!

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.770
Miss, can you please move.

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:18.980
Gai! Gai!

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:29.110
Sayaka.

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:31.610
Gai, thank goodness.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:34.490
So, you're awake?

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:38.910
But that's not the face I want to see.

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:43.500
Wh-What?

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:46.250
You're really cute, aren't you?

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:48.920
You smell so good!

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:50.880
Gai, get up!

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:56.180
G-Get off me, you old geezer!

00:07:58.060 --> 00:08:01.600
I can have more fun with you
than I can watching the fight!

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:04.980
I'll kill you.

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:07.690
Are you sure?

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:14.280
Now that the child's escaped,
don't you need me to tell you where he is?

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:16.990
You bastard.

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:20.200
His arm is made from a sword
called the Shiryu.

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:23.580
I can take you to someone who knows more.

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:25.540
Alright.

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:28.710
But the next time you get
within one meter of me,

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:32.420
I'll slice off your head,
you stinking old man!

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:35.970
You've got a lot to learn!

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:48.020
So he's come to me
to learn about Gai and the Shiryu?

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:49.440
Indeed.

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:56.490
You said that you gave the boy the Shiryu
to cut the blade of his heart, yes?

00:08:57.320 --> 00:08:58.160
Indeed.

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:01.160
And what is his blade?

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:06.620
As you know,
Gai's mother took her own life.

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:13.880
Even now, years later,
his heart is trapped within her dark womb.

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:20.100
Gai?

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:21.600
Sayaka.

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:23.020
Are you okay?

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:24.520
Yeah.

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:26.690
How strange.

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:28.650
It's healed already.

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:31.190
What happened to me?

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:34.900
<i>Kill.</i>

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:36.740
<i>Kill.</i>

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:38.700
The Shiryu.

00:09:38.780 --> 00:09:41.700
It's fine.
There's nothing to worry about, okay?

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:46.660
Once the rain stops,
let's go back and ask Father for help.

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:48.580
He'll do something to fix this.

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:55.300
Anyway, remember how we always
used to come play in this cave?

00:09:55.970 --> 00:09:58.970
This brings back memories
of when we were kids.

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:02.850
I don't have any pleasant memories.

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:07.310
I always ran away from home
when I was a kid.

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:08.270
I know.

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:10.400
But you always came back.

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:12.570
That's right.

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:17.280
Because every time I ran away,

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:19.780
I realized I had nowhere to go.

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:22.330
Running from what?

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:24.740
You don't mean from us?

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:27.330
I mean the darkness.

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:29.620
The darkness?

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:32.750
No matter how far I ran, it followed me.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:37.050
I searched as hard as I could
for a different world.

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:40.510
But it was no good.
There was only one world.

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:46.180
This dark world followed me everywhere
and would try to kill me.

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:47.680
It was waiting for me.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:56.570
I couldn't escape, even if I tried.

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:59.900
That's why I decided
to change the way I thought.

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:02.280
I would kill the world.

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:04.740
Using the swords I forge,

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:08.910
I'd slice open the world,
and the darkness trying to kill me.

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:16.300
Stop it, Gai. You're scaring me!

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:21.430
Even if you can't run from the darkness,
there's still light in the world!

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:24.600
Light? I don't have anything like that.

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:27.930
You and I live in different worlds.

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:30.060
We see different things.

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:34.860
You have Father and me!

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:38.070
We've been your family
since you were born!

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:40.280
I have no family!

00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:44.070
I'm grateful to my master,
but he's not my father.

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:45.280
No.

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:49.750
I'm going to sleep for a bit.
Leave me alone.

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:50.660
Gai.

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:58.380
But what is the Shiryu?

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:04.720
You told me before that
it was a sword made by something inhuman.

00:12:05.430 --> 00:12:11.940
Yes, it's a legend that we swordsmiths
have passed down for years.

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:15.650
The Shiryu was forged by a dragon.

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:20.690
<i>In the middle of the Muromachi period,</i>

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:23.740
<i>at a place not far from the capital,</i>

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:27.870
<i>there was a shrine
<i>where the horn of a dragon was worshiped.</i></i>

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:36.460
<i>But one of the servants was overcome
<i>with a wicked idea.</i></i>

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:40.550
Hurry!

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:47.550
But is it true?
Is it really a dragon horn?

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:50.520
If we do all this and it's a fake...

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:52.020
That's impossible!

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:28.140
The girl became pregnant and gave birth.

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:34.020
But the baby was covered with scales,
and had the eyes and horns of a dragon.

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:39.020
<i>So they wrapped it up
<i>and sent it down the river.</i></i>

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:52.410
<i>The baby was taken in
<i>by an aged swordsmith</i></i>

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:54.080
<i>and later became his student.</i>

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:04.550
Strike straighter, along the back side.

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:05.670
Y-Yes sir.

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:20.020
<i>After that, the dragon swordsmith
<i>continued the business.</i></i>

00:14:20.100 --> 00:14:23.690
<i>He improved his skills,
<i>and eventually became famous.</i></i>

00:14:28.650 --> 00:14:32.450
The eyes are okay, and also the skin.
Good, and any claws?

00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:34.790
He's not like me! Not at all!

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:43.460
<i>The dragon swordsmith's reputation reached
<i>the shogun at the time, Yoshiki Ashikaga,</i></i>

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:49.090
<i>who ordered him to create a sword
<i>without equal.</i></i>

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:55.390
<i>So he began work to create
<i>the greatest blade of his generation.</i></i>

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:07.150
We'd like you to present it to the shogun
in person.

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:11.450
But I cannot present myself to others.

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:12.950
The shogun demands it!

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:18.410
So you made this? Raise your head.

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:22.170
Your reputation precedes you,
and I've anticipated seeing this sword.

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:24.250
What is that?

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:27.760
That covering on your head! Remove it!

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:28.760
Take it off now!

00:15:39.430 --> 00:15:42.060
Disgusting. A blade made by a monster.

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:44.810
Put him and his family to death!

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:52.490
<i>His wife and child were then executed.</i>

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:56.620
Please don't hurt my wife and child!
I beg of you!

00:15:57.290 --> 00:16:00.580
It has already been done!
They await you in the next world.

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:02.790
This cannot be! This cannot be!

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:10.010
<i>But blades could not pierce his skin.</i>

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:12.430
<i>His life energy
<i>was beyond human understanding,</i></i>

00:16:12.510 --> 00:16:15.640
<i>and no method of execution
<i>could harm him.</i></i>

00:16:17.430 --> 00:16:20.810
<i>In the end, they gave up,</i>

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:25.020
<i>and settled on throwing him
<i>into the sea many leagues away.</i></i>

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:30.740
<i>Why can't I die?</i>

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:35.320
<i>Does my existence go against
<i>the laws of nature?</i></i>

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:39.870
<i>Why did heaven and earth grant me life?</i>

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:57.180
<i>Very well.</i>

00:16:58.050 --> 00:17:00.390
<i>Then I shall reject both heaven and earth,</i>

00:17:00.470 --> 00:17:03.680
<i>and leave the scars of my wrath
<i>upon this world.</i></i>

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:22.580
Yoshiki, know my wrath!

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:30.000
<i>And with the lesser of the swords,
<i>he slew himself.</i></i>

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:35.630
<i>It's said his immortal body,
<i>which no blade could pierce,</i></i>

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:40.890
<i>accepted the Shiryu
<i>with no resistance at all.</i></i>

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:42.810
What is that?

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:50.400
<i>After that, the two Shiryu went missing.</i>

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:54.030
<i>But it's sometimes said
<i>that the shadow of the Shiryu</i></i>

00:17:54.110 --> 00:17:57.820
<i>can be seen when important
<i>or powerful people are slain.</i></i>

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:02.240
A terrible story.

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:05.540
It explains the Shiryu's murderous rage.

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:06.910
Right?

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:10.420
Are you crying?

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:12.130
How awful.

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:16.220
That part where the wife and child
were murdered was so sad!

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:20.090
H-He's more tender-hearted
than I thought.

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:22.220
Here, wipe.

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:31.020
But there's plenty of stories about kids
who had hard lives due to cursed swords.

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:33.190
At least, among people like us.

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:38.610
I sense you are the same as Gai,
one who is chased by darkness.

00:18:39.070 --> 00:18:40.740
Who are you?

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:46.450
Someone as fortunate as you
doesn't need to know who I am.

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:55.210
I'm only interested in that Gai kid.
I'm staying here till he gets back.

00:19:01.760 --> 00:19:02.600
Hey.

00:19:04.430 --> 00:19:05.260
You're...

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:12.900
The look on your face says
it's kill or be killed.

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:23.990
You want to go
to a different world than this?

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:27.290
A different world?

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:31.370
This isn't the world you belong in.

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:36.340
I'll tell you who you are,
and of the fate you can't avoid.

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:38.050
At the Shoshidai.

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:39.670
The Shoshidai?

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:42.010
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:50.690
It's your decision, Gai.
You're old enough to leave if you wish.

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:52.520
Master.

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:55.900
You may stay here
and follow the path of the swordsmith.

00:19:56.440 --> 00:20:00.440
But I see that he walks
the same path as you.

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:05.280
Perhaps it's best that you go with him,
along with the Shiryu.

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:06.780
But Father!

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:11.000
Let him go, miss.
That man is not a bad guy.

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:13.040
Y-You too, Mr. Kigetsu?

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:17.210
Gai is a sword yet to be fully forged.

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:20.460
I can't wait to see
what kind of sword he becomes!

00:20:20.970 --> 00:20:22.380
B-But...

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:27.640
Is this yours?

00:20:28.310 --> 00:20:29.890
Why is it in such bad shape?

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:31.310
Shut up.

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:36.020
You really will take me
to the world where I belong, right?

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:39.650
Just get in.
A real man never goes back on his word.

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:42.400
Gai, wait!

00:20:42.490 --> 00:20:43.360
Let's go.

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:46.280
Sayaka.

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:52.790
Gai!

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:55.880
I'm heading out.

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:57.590
Have a good day, sir.

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:07.140
The Shiryu is crying again.
